# Odd path tokens without an image-consuming shader.
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 1 nofile input 1 file /dev/null
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
```
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 1 nofile input 1 file /etc/hostname
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
```
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 1 nofile input 1 file a/b/c/d/e.png
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
```
